it’s an emotional rollercoaster. You’re saying goodbye to the place where you might have brought home your first kid or hosted your first Thanksgiving. But if you want to walk away with the most money possible—and your sanity intact—you have to treat this like a business. Most first-time sellers go into the process blind, and that’s where the mistakes happen.

